{"id":"de14d8d6c42250de","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-characteristic.md","title":"特征函数","display":"df-characteristic — 特征函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-characteristic","aliases":["20-df-characteristic"],"display":"df-characteristic — 特征函数","chapter":"17","section":"17.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 17.2.2","source_pdf_pages":[257],"source_printed_pages":[230],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-characteristic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-characteristic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-characteristic — 特征函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"17"},{"key":"section","html":"17.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 17.2.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>257</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>230</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,n\\in\\omega\">\\(x,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in2\">\\(b\\in2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Arg}_k\">\\(\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pack}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{pack}_k\\)</span> 是上游定义的数值输入载体及元组转换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^k\">\\(\\omega^k\\)</span> 仍表示实际的长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 序列集合。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\chi_A:=\\{(x,b)\\in\\omega\\times2:\n(b=1\\land x\\in A)\\lor(b=0\\land x\\notin A)\\},\\qquad\n\\chi_A:\\omega\\to2,\\\\\n\\chi_R^{(k)}:=\\{(\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x),b):\n\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\land b\\in2\\land\n[(b=1\\land\\vec x\\in R)\\lor(b=0\\land\\vec x\\notin R)]\\},\\qquad\n\\chi_R^{(k)}:\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\to2.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\chi_A:=\\{(x,b)\\in\\omega\\times2:\n(b=1\\land x\\in A)\\lor(b=0\\land x\\notin A)\\},\\qquad\n\\chi_A:\\omega\\to2,\\\\\n\\chi_R^{(k)}:=\\{(\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x),b):\n\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\land b\\in2\\land\n[(b=1\\land\\vec x\\in R)\\lor(b=0\\land\\vec x\\notin R)]\\},\\qquad\n\\chi_R^{(k)}:\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\to2.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{set}(X):=\\{n\\in\\omega:X(n)=1\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{set}(X):=\\{n\\in\\omega:X(n)=1\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不带元数标记的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 只对自然数集合定义，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>。关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\)</span> 的特征函数另以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_R^{(k)}\">\\(\\chi_R^{(k)}\\)</span> 标出输入元数，并通过 pack 转为数值函数；特别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=1\">\\(k=1\\)</span> 时，它在数值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 上检测的是单项序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x)\">\\((x)\\)</span> 是否属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>。这没有把自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 与有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x)\">\\((x)\\)</span> 认作同一集合。</p>\n<p>集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的初段和串前缀比较分别显式写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\\upharpoonright n\">\\(\\chi_A\\upharpoonright n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A\">\\(\\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\\succeq\\sigma\">\\(\\chi_A\\succeq\\sigma\\)</span>。不再将这些操作重载到集合参数：空集合同时也是空串，在这两个角色下其初段和可延伸条件不同。集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>、其特征函数与串集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 各有独立载体；以函数作 oracle 时可使用其图的配对编码。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 17.2.2；印刷页 230；PDF 第 257 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in2","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Arg}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pack}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\chi_A:=\\{(x,b)\\in\\omega\\times2:\n(b=1\\land x\\in A)\\lor(b=0\\land x\\notin A)\\},\\qquad\n\\chi_A:\\omega\\to2,\\\\\n\\chi_R^{(k)}:=\\{(\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x),b):\n\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\land b\\in2\\land\n[(b=1\\land\\vec x\\in R)\\lor(b=0\\land\\vec x\\notin R)]\\},\\qquad\n\\chi_R^{(k)}:\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\to2.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{set}(X):=\\{n\\in\\omega:X(n)=1\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_R^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"k=1","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"(x)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"(x)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A\\upharpoonright n","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\preceq\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A\\succeq\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false}],"bytes":2263,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca9bd78f895ed48e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic]]。"},{"id":"3850151d9f29cbf4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"c803835be7de786d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic]]。"},{"id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic]]。"},{"id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic]]。"},{"id":"2af550cdf8ea0be2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]。"},{"id":"140c